        "quote": "(a) Members of the Police Department are hereby authorized to remove a vehicle violating the provisions of this chapter to the nearest private garage or lot or to a garage or lot or other place designated or maintained by the Police Department or otherwise maintained by this City, and to hold the vehicle until all the procedural requirements for claiming the vehicle established by TMC 10.25.040 are satisfied.",
